mmary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Running Windows 10.\n\nI am testing my app on a Win10 home server with no physical monitor attached (I am connecting through VNC so the graphics driver still works for everything else).\n\nIgnoring the cause of why glfwGetMonitors returns NULL for now, the documentation for glfwGetMonitors states that if it returns NULL an error has occured, however I get no error callback? This resulted in undefined behaviour as the app continued executing after glfwGetMonitors returned null (surely enough it crashes later on though).\n\nI thought it was safe to assume that glfwSetErrorCallback will catch all errors?\n","closed_by":{"login":"elmindreda","id":133714,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzcxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133714?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda","html_url":"https://github.com/elmindreda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmindreda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glfw/glfw/issues/594/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}